      "categoryID": 4,
      "benefits": "Proposed rationale: a premix of no-DAC CJC-1295 and ipamorelin intended to stimulate the GH axis. Human ipamorelin research supports a hormone-release effect for that component alone. No direct efficacy study of this premixed product was located, so improved recovery, sleep, muscle gain, fat loss, or longevity cannot be presented as demonstrated blend benefits. Findings for DAC CJC-1295 do not establish effects of its no-DAC counterpart."
    }
